---
title: Pasta with parmesan and pepper
servings: 2
tags: [quick, vegetarian, weeknight]
source: Invented for this repository
---

Boil the @dried pasta{200%g} in well-salted water in a #large pot{}, ~{9%minutes},
until just short of done.

Meanwhile toast the @black peppercorns{2%tsp}, coarsely cracked, in a #wide pan{}
over medium heat ~{1%minute} until fragrant.

Ladle in @pasta water{150%ml} and let it bubble. Drag the drained pasta through
it, then take the pan off the heat.

Add the @parmesan{60%g}, finely grated, a handful at a time, tossing constantly
until the sauce turns glossy rather than grainy. Loosen with more pasta water as
needed.
